&_nc_ohc=UiH8Z5GXNO4Q7kNvwF4-GYY&_nc_oc=AdoygW9FaX2ArKe2IhOpv8cW7fFmQl8ntul58V35pF-31e5FiBNPqfN5gEHP0-p6wns&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTlag5RRV3etz9QjY5C2xqxARIH-P-ZoMDaq5GyITERHQ&oe=6AEE0443"}]}, "id": "4356029028044012", "locale": "pt_BR", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "home_10_Quest.png", "id": "1471900691162468", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307435_1471900694495801_4829947570561919049_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7qbnLh9LY9kQ7kNvwHV1a_C&_nc_oc=AdrdZwH2nhG0JRWvQDXzoZVR1c15lXh_uHB6YL203srTKrI0oau6DK6Rb_I-__N1n-w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNPKV-TXudEaJbzmDF0wRtcEzHEB9t0afaDoGbvDygQg&oe=6AEDFACB"}, {"file_name": "settings_10_Quest.png", "id": "1391193859145570", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308010_1391193862478903_5269474807905197381_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lccTSS9gfjEQ7kNvwEfrIR6&_nc_oc=AdqfEbktt_LGkJet3W_X5WHp_gKkw9UZoQtgHRO52csISZiAcw2H8aun6ttxMJPCgUU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTXitfiiBsDHj6NgTa97jduFbYKzGXgw7ZpZWAPAoECnA&oe=6AEDD941"}, {"file_name": "home_10_settings_Quest.png", "id": "890412220264365", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310817_890412223597698_6569410573752295327_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ugJwEunnpukQ7kNvwFeGe-d&_nc_oc=AdrjfzRc6i_1Fba7uiVO7-BHX6BjLVATSWSynwR7e1cxGPQCvierVLPQEBjQpWt2YsI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ7namE_0lXBFScOxgeQFoa__c33R2U4QBA9DAKChqKwA&oe=6AEDF284"}, {"file_name": "edit_10_Quest.png", "id": "1209432111385989", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310731_1209432114719322_5500871760126419425_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k_sBrUkTmcUQ7kNvwEpiI3Q&_nc_oc=AdqDhNCUHAlCjfFXYHPfckhb4nLvuMMdgODqBglRsHTniPvgRGGfJ9L-4s9B-E1B8kA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTjk7RIo3g0lV7q-3vrRzdbvzcOJ1eLcevuVglOaPMiEw&oe=6AEDE641"}, {"file_name": "player_10_Quest.png", "id": "908261954943342", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303746_908261961610008_2600051788214719246_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8FnUMKTDHW8Q7kNvwH7tXtH&_nc_oc=Adq5QwvKgEAl1XfPmTFzO9SF6E0H0AQErnuxaoz8E_iUNcBzgaMMnmGXOvW1dRuhJeI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSzNMmo-dkr1m5jHji9U22-qjcU9HI8TV4jKCt3QpqWUQ&oe=6AEDDAE2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Cifraria", "keywords": ["Viol\u00e3o", "Ukulele", "Cifras", "Letras", "Biblioteca"], "long_description": "O **Cifraria** \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e de gerenciamento de cifras desenvolvido em Flutter.\nCriado para m\u00fasicos de todos os n\u00edveis, oferece uma experi\u00eancia fluida para gerenciar, transpor e praticar suas m\u00fasicas favoritas, tanto no celular quanto no Quest.\n\n\u2728 **Funcionalidades**\n\n\ud83d\udcc2 **Arquitetura Inteligente**: Organize suas m\u00fasicas em pastas personalizadas com uma barra lateral em glassmorphism (efeito de vidro) para um visual premium e moderno.\n\n\ud83d\udcdc **Gest\u00e3o de Repert\u00f3rios**: Crie listas personalizadas e organize as m\u00fasicas na ordem exata da sua apresenta\u00e7\u00e3o.\n\n\ud83d\udcf2 **Compartilhamento Pro**: Exporte seus repert\u00f3rios atrav\u00e9s da extens\u00e3o exclusiva .cifraria via apps de mensagem ou utilize o QR Code para que outro dispositivo com o app recrie a lista e as m\u00fasicas automaticamente.\n\n\ud83d\udd04 **Transposi\u00e7\u00e3o Instant\u00e2nea**: Mude o tom das m\u00fasicas em tempo real com um motor de transposi\u00e7\u00e3o robusto.\n\n\u2601\ufe0f **Sincroniza\u00e7\u00e3o em Nuvem (Google Drive)**: Fa\u00e7a backup e restaure com seguran\u00e7a toda a sua biblioteca, incluindo pastas e m\u00fasicas favoritas.\n\n\ud83d\udcf1 **Pronto para o Meta Quest**: Modo paisagem otimizado e dimensionamento de interface para um ambiente de pr\u00e1tica imersivo e sem distra\u00e7\u00f5es no Meta Quest.\n\n\ud83d\udcc4 **Importa\u00e7\u00e3o Multiformato**: Importe cifras da web (extra\u00e7\u00e3o com apenas um clique) ou de arquivos locais (PDF e DOCX).\n\n\ud83c\udfb6 **Cifras Interativas**: Acordes clic\u00e1veis com gera\u00e7\u00e3o autom\u00e1tica de diagramas, com suporte para Viol\u00e3o e Ukulele.\n\n\u26a1 **Foco em Performance**: Banco de dados local para carregamento instant\u00e2neo e funcionamento 100% offline.", "short_description": "O Cifraria \u00e9 uma biblioteca profissional de m\u00fasicas e o seu aplicativo definitivo para gerenciar cifras."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_1440.png", "id": "25137093062632621", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_25137093065965954_5340243871155545084_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jM5OMZu_OYUQ7kNvwGxg4fM&_nc_oc=AdosHS-dvB4TT5K-0GGZDsnb750Tf-eRUxUcwN-xvZN6blKv51zwTAcb2Xh3Yz-yWp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQP5DMO2WZMuyIevPvaVfhfnZm21VgaQjrS37d9lnBiJA&oe=6AEDE124"}, {"file_name": "icon_app_cifraria_512.png", "id": "1950929249182186", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308090_1950929252515519_3579238828299289210_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oSPJ0Py9mLUQ7kNvwHt6ww8&_nc_oc=AdqdwY7WabjUnZI4eh64Zc_6bpz1OV2B82Fj1spVUY94FwixbnhMXsfbQ9uKoJhlldI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-cyVRYuVrM56lrH1CPlKRd00EynPat24bZ-FyYew0og&oe=6AEDE3FC"}, {"file_name": "cover art cifraria.png", "id": "1221596580110880", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307422_1221596583444213_1996221161851683055_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a3KMoy9cOeQQ7kNvwF4